t: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh7kU-5cNdgKe13Dn7tUS0vKLdzBYzsG3Xm9BEJkzz0lotIrYlUh25GF6aJkyGtOfR-yHOFVlrR_pPHA0x-WNVgrF-7dTrIgvYyjYE4x7g3xVvimR3qUBmMS7_2LfvP3pPIZbqw_qqS8WUXGYkOehRdBSp0dHn2HDgrTOWvht4nXzJRov8CzxkufGb0RpwP\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh9zlLHKXn0ausMjHsC3f5y44pzjp671zuns7e1b11m37KEfXd_ZTVw21oCh_caVHyTP0DSY4OHgMqj12jWHgIFT1v99naeGQAQrbcyofRghv8GpFAVDs2LR7ikq-rHzNO4xD10Njv1QPxlEqrDQbNjtMA1RuCPKUVy2xpMIYoRRM-_GntT-E-W9MHNSv62\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh9zlLHKXn0ausMjHsC3f5y44pzjp671zuns7e1b11m37KEfXd_ZTVw21oCh_caVHyTP0DSY4OHgMqj12jWHgIFT1v99naeGQAQrbcyofRghv8GpFAVDs2LR7ikq-rHzNO4xD10Njv1QPxlEqrDQbNjtMA1RuCPKUVy2xpMIYoRRM-_GntT-E-W9MHNSv62\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjISMwh37wJKBEhwV8v2qiW5-LO3Ry-bjEXi1iuxbT-wm44zFPeL_qE1ftcFZaiBgmQ2Q69gWA1owAxUr1NPvm9zpxSYrc49PqKccKiizNE138BzKpQXlU5pF2b0UDuQaQ16M0E4wTQxCdCBhFb6QM0iC9oo85ZPmP2LUBIL6NfWRXaKFx_P04lDZwTo8rj\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjISMwh37wJKBEhwV8v2qiW5-LO3Ry-bjEXi1iuxbT-wm44zFPeL_qE1ftcFZaiBgmQ2Q69gWA1owAxUr1NPvm9zpxSYrc49PqKccKiizNE138BzKpQXlU5pF2b0UDuQaQ16M0E4wTQxCdCBhFb6QM0iC9oo85ZPmP2LUBIL6NfWRXaKFx_P04lDZwTo8rj=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><br /></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">氣象專家講ē直接來台灣ê Doksuri（『杜蘇芮』）風颱，後--來tuì本島ê南爿tshu--過，無踏tsiūnn岸。但是伊ê中心經過南部hit phiàn海，全台灣lóng感受--著--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">風，吹到台北hit工，我罕罕--à紮雨傘出門，風雨有大有細，一tsūn一tsūn teh吹，上大ê時，親像規个城市kiōng-beh píng--過。Iáu未行到公車站，雨傘骨就斷兩枝--ah，拗bē tńg--來。走tsông規晡坐起去hit台khah早m̄ bat坐--過ê 508號公車，ǹg河ê hit一爿去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tuì士林beh去蘆洲ê阿舅in兜，近近--ā，通常是騎oo-tóo-bái，tī tsit款歹天ê日，用生份ê方式去到熟sāi ê所在，雨落tī外面，人坐tī車內，身軀m̄免tín動就ē到位，心頭亂，m̄敢koh hōo亂，提出手機仔，tuè地圖行，uat入去巷仔內，peh起去公寓ê二樓，入門，huah人，去房間看阿喜阿公，三點鐘過--去，hit暗阿喜就走--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">風颱來︐來到台北ê時，kā阿喜吹走，外口烏天暗地，mā有雨沃tī我ê目睭內。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2139\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: 